pentax-shader is a modified Rust port of portions of KytyPS5-Performance,
not an independent implementation of those portions.

Source project: https://github.com/WerrySs/KytyPS5-Performance
Pinned source: 209dffe9032d72749257ce18680d506b891284de
Upstream project: https://github.com/KytyPS5/KytyPS5

Ported source files under src/graphics/shader/recompiler/frontend/decode/:
  ShaderDecoder.h and ShaderDecoder.cpp (family, opcode vocabulary, operand
    and instruction metadata decoding)
  OpcodeTable.h (opcode table lookup semantics)
  ScalarAluOps.cpp (complete scalar opcode maps and instruction decoding)
  ExportOps.cpp (export instruction decoding)
  VectorAluOps.cpp (VOP1/VOP2/VOPC/VOP3/VOP3P/VINTRP maps and decoding)
  MemoryOps.cpp (SMEM/MUBUF/MTBUF/FLAT/DS maps and decoding)
  ImageOps.cpp (MIMG maps, decoding and address component layout)
Stage vocabulary is from src/graphics/shader/shader.h.

